  "claim_localizations": [
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-household-and-official-birch-registers-differ","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В изученном корпусе бытовые грамоты обычно диалектны, а официальные документы чаще ориентированы на наддиалектные древнерусские нормы и могут сохранять диалектизмы. Это различие корпуса, не правило речи или письма конкретного персонажа.","search_aliases":["диалект","официальный документ"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-household-and-official-birch-registers-differ","locale":"en","runtime_text":"In the documented corpus, household letters are normally dialectal while official documents usually orient to supradialectal Old-Russian norms and can retain dialectisms. This is a corpus distinction, not a character rule.","search_aliases":["dialect","official document"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-church-texts-have-pure-or-mixed-church-slavonic-context","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Церковные тексты и перечисленные заговоры в корпусе могут быть написаны на чистом церковнославянском или смешанном языке. Это не назначает реплику, веру или грамотность персонажу.","search_aliases":["церковнославянский","заговор"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-church-texts-have-pure-or-mixed-church-slavonic-context","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Church texts and listed charms in the corpus can be in pure Church Slavonic or mixed language. This assigns no utterance, belief, or literacy to an actor.","search_aliases":["Church Slavonic","charm"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-fragmentary-birch-text-readings-can-be-revised","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Фрагментарные берестяные тексты могут иметь неуверенно опознанные буквы, а чтения и переводы могут уточняться позднейшими исследованиями. Это граница интерпретации источника, не недостоверность конкретной грамоты.","search_aliases":["фрагмент","чтение","перевод"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-fragmentary-birch-text-readings-can-be-revised","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Fragmentary birch texts can have uncertain letter identification and readings or translations revised by later study. This is a source boundary, not unreliability of a particular letter.","search_aliases":["fragment","reading","translation"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-name-only-owner-labels-have-disputed-function","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"В корпусе есть около двух десятков ярлычков только с именем владельца; их функция остаётся спорной. Это не список имён, система отчеств или личность в сцене.","search_aliases":["ярлычок","имя владельца"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-name-only-owner-labels-have-disputed-function","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The corpus includes about two dozen labels bearing only an owner's name; their function remains disputed. This is not a name list, patronymic system, or scene identity.","search_aliases":["label","owner name"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-birch-letter-etiquette-formulas-aid-dating","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Характер этикетных формул берестяных писем служит одним из средств их датирования. Это не реконструированное приветствие, титул или социальная иерархия.","search_aliases":["этикетная формула","датировка"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-birch-letter-etiquette-formulas-aid-dating","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The character of etiquette formulas in birch letters is one aid to their dating. It is not a reconstructed greeting, title, or social hierarchy.","search_aliases":["etiquette formula","dating"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-birch-writing-used-styli-on-inner-surface","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Засвидетельствованные берестяные грамоты обычно выдавливали или выцарапывали специальным металлическим либо костяным писалóм, чаще на внутренней стороне листа. Это практика корпуса, не предмет или писец в сцене.","search_aliases":["береста","писало"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-birch-writing-used-styli-on-inner-surface","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Documented birch letters were generally pressed or scratched with dedicated metal or bone styli, most often on the bark’s inner side. This is corpus practice, not a scene object or writer.","search_aliases":["birch bark","stylus"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-private-letters-and-practical-registers-are-corpus-categories","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Корпус преимущественно состоит из частных писем о текущих хозяйственных, семейных, денежных и торговых делах; в нём есть долговые списки и росписи денежных либо натуральных поставок. Это состав корпуса, не грамотность, доставка или текущий счёт.","search_aliases":["частное письмо","долговой список","поставка"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-private-letters-and-practical-registers-are-corpus-categories","locale":"en","runtime_text":"The corpus is predominantly private letters on current household, family, monetary, and trade matters; it also includes debt lists and money-or-kind supply registers. This is corpus composition, not literacy, delivery, or a current account.","search_aliases":["private letter","debt list","supply register"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-practical-registers-can-be-memory-aids-or-collection-instructions","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Долговые и поставочные реестры могли быть личной памяткой или письменным распоряжением взыскать указанные долги. Это не определяет функцию конкретной записи, долг или результат взыскания.","search_aliases":["реестр","долг","распоряжение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-practical-registers-can-be-memory-aids-or-collection-instructions","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Debt and supply registers could be personal memory aids or written instructions to collect specified debts. This determines neither a particular record’s function, a debt, nor a collection outcome.","search_aliases":["register","debt","instruction"]},
    {"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-instructional-birch-texts-include-alphabets-numerals-syllables-exercises","locale":"ru","runtime_text":"Среди засвидетельствованных учебных берестяных текстов есть азбуки, перечни цифр, склады и упражнения. Это типы текстов, не школа, учитель, ученик, программа или распределение грамотности в 1230 году.","search_aliases":["азбука","цифры","слоги","упражнение"]},{"schema":"world_knowledge_claim_localization_v1","claim_ref":"claim:residual-v1-instructional-birch-texts-include-alphabets-numerals-syllables-exercises","locale":"en","runtime_text":"Attested instructional birch texts include alphabets, numeral lists, syllables, and exercises. These are text types, not a school, teacher, pupil, curriculum, or 1230 literacy distribution.","search_aliases":["alphabet","numerals","syllables","exercise"]}
  ]
